From: Yi-Chia Hsieh <yi-chia.hsieh@mediatek.com>
Date: Wed, 3 May 2023 05:08:07 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mt76: mt7996: add vendor commands

nl80211 vendor command interface for mt7996: available BSS color
bitmap query, radio-indexed EDCCA control (enable and thresholds,
consumed by hostapd), and preamble puncture (PP) mode control.

Squash of the following MediaTek commits:
- wifi: mt76: mt7996: add vendor cmd to get available color bitmap
  (Yi-Chia Hsieh, 2023-05-03)
- wifi: mt76: mt7996: add vendor subcmd EDCCA ctrl enable
  (Rex Lu, 2023-06-08)
- wifi: mt76: mt7996: support enable/disable pp feature by nl80211
  vendor commands (Howard Hsu, 2023-09-25)
---
